sequenceDiagram
    participant Producer
    participant Broker as Queue or topic
    participant Consumer
    participant Store as Owned data

    Producer->>Broker: Publish event with idempotency key
    Broker->>Consumer: Deliver event
    Consumer->>Store: Apply change idempotently
    Consumer-->>Broker: Acknowledge
    Note over Consumer,Broker: Define retries, ordering, and failure queue behavior
